===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|letter}}, {{m|enm|lettre}}, from {{der|en|fro|letre}}, from {{der|en|la|littera||letter of the alphabet"; ''in plural'', "epistle}}, from {{der|en|ett|-}}, from {{der|en|grc|διφθέρᾱ||tablet}}. Related to {{m|en|diphtheria}}. {{displaced|ang|bōcstæf|lit=book staff}} in sense 1 and {{m|ang|ǣrendġewrit|lit=message writing}} in sense 2.

